# Resource budget (docs/resource-budget.md, ADR 0006). Changing a default requires an ADR.
# Each value can be overridden from the environment (CI uses a looser startup limit).
#
# Memory is budgeted as PRIVATE memory (Private_Dirty from /proc/<pid>/smaps_rollup), not
# RSS: ~40 MB of a Qt6 Widgets process's RSS is shared file-backed pages (Qt libraries,
# fontconfig caches, locale) that every Qt app shares and that our code cannot influence.
: "${QK_BUDGET_PRIVATE_KB:=16384}"   # 16 MiB private memory at idle (M0 baseline ~11.5 MiB)
: "${QK_BUDGET_CPU_PERMILLE:=1}"     # CPU over the idle window, 1/1000 of one core (0.1 %)
: "${QK_BUDGET_STARTUP_MS:=150}"     # process start -> first paint (best of 5)
